umns (or vice versa), that's the bug.\n\nAlso, maybe \"display settings\" refers to the \"Sort Field\" / \"Card Type\"/\"Note Type\" header labels. Those were correct.\n\nLet me check Manage columns in Notes mode now (dialog open, Notes selected)."}
