he second Save had Cards radio checked. So saved mode = Cards. Current dialog radio Notes changed but unsaved. So Manage columns showing cards columns could be legitimately due to unsaved state.\n\nHmm. Let me be rigorous. Go back (unsaved), open options, select Notes, Save, verify browser shows Notes columns, then reopen options (notes mode), Manage columns, check columns = notes columns. If it shows Sort Field/Card Type/Due/Deck again, that's the bug.\n\nLet's cancel out of Manage columns via back arrow."}
