{"type": "thinking", "text": "Restored. Good.\n\nNow let me think about the \"cards/notes display settings\" bug again. What display settings are per mode in AnkiDroid? Columns = definitely per mode. Truncate/ignore accents = single prefs. Hmm, maybe the bug is about the **sort order** which is per mode. Let's test sort order.\n\nUse \"Change display order\" in Notes: choose \"Tags\" descending (or Note Modified). Then switch to Cards, open \"Change display order\": which is selected? If it shows the same selection (Tags, which is notes-only), that's cross-mode leak → bug. If Cards keeps its own sort (Sort Field ascending), fine. Then switch back to Notes: sort persisted.\n\nLet's test. Notes mode now. Overflow > Change display order."}
