ind and replace, Create filtered deck, deck options, custom study, export. And add/edit: Preview, tag filter, note type change, cards.\n\nPotential bug candidates:\n- **Preview** might show wrong content.\n- **Find and replace** might replace in the wrong field or report wrong count.\n- **Filter by flag** might show wrong.\n- **Rename flags**.\n- **Deck options**.\n- **Custom study**.\n\nLet me test Preview quickly: select comer card, Preview. But we're in Aaa 0 notes... Actually Cards mode Aaa has 2 cards. Preview would show revfront. Let's do Preview from menu [6]? Wait we're still in Add editor. Back once more. Then browser Aaa 2 cards. Tap first card? Preview via menu.\n\nLet me exit editor."}
